      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ran into another reproducible occurence; I have a GameObject that contains most of my constraints, and enabling the GameObject in the inspector triggers a freeze; see picture below.\n\nAdditionally, using Revert to reset the position/rotation of a related object in the inspector can also trigger a freeze.",
